WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.890
- During the winter school
that will run for three days,

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.440
There will be a series
of different sessions.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.270
Some of them will be
plenary talks speaking about

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.900
different aspects of the
science of consciousness,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.160
but there will also be some social events.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.840
So you get to interact
with leading researchers.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.650
Leading consciousness researchers.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.030
- It's a unique opportunity
for young scientists

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:24.860
to get engaged with people,
they've read the papers of.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.480
We've all had this
experience as scientists

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.650
of actually meeting for the first time

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.350
one of the people we admire,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.380
or one of the people we disagree with or

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.880
one of the people who influenced our work.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.730
- People get divided

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.840
into teams that become
these little communities

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.570
and they get to work on projects

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.187
and they have a lot of time outside of

00:00:43.187 --> 00:00:46.440
just lecture time to interact

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.810
both socially and scientifically

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:52.480
and I think that really builds
relationships that last.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.840
- And at the end of it, I
think you'll come away equipped

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.540
with a whole lot of skills and experience

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.410
that will be really valuable
in your academic career

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.640
or in fact, in whatever
you want to do next.

